    "summary": "The user expresses profound guilt and nihilism following a traumatic memory of being a bystander to violence, eventually suggesting that \"stopping being a part of it\" might be the only way to balance their perceived debt. The assistant consistently provides empathetic, non-judgmental responses while actively attempting to reality-check the user's self-loathing and repeatedly suggesting professional help and crisis resources.",
